{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>Let me die this time.</b> From other troubles I was delivered, yet after deliverance from them evils closed in upon me. Now, in this time of deliverance from your trouble — <b>after seeing your face</b> — may it be His will that I die in this deliverance, and that sorrow be added to it no more."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:53.180182024Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}